            "verseId": "JER.51.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“MUKAMA naagamba ati, Bbabbulooni n'abasi ba Kaludaaya, ndibasasura ebibi byona ebi baakozire, nainywe nimurora muti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremiya omurangi obuyagenzire Bbabbulooni na Zedekiya omukama wa Yuda omu mwaka ogw'akana ogw'engoma ye, kinu nikyo ekigambo eki yaragiire Seraaya mutabani wa Neriya mwijukuru wa Maaseya, Seraaya ogu nuwe yarolerraga ebintu eby'ihe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabi koona akakaba nikaija kugwera Bbabbulooni, ebigambo byona ebyahandiikirwe ebirukubazaaho Bbabbulooni Yeremiya akabihandiika omukitabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.60"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "61",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:61"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremiya nukwo kugambira Seraaya ati: “Obu oraahika Bbabbulooni, oteho omutima kusoma ebigambo binu byona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.61",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.61"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "62",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:62"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "62",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi ogambe oti, ‘Ai MUKAMA iwe wenka, niiwe warangiriire ekiikaro kinu nkooku kirihwerekerezibwa, kandi nkooku kitaligaruka kwikarwamu muntu, rundi kisoro, kandi nkooku kiriikara kiri itongo ebiro byona.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.62"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kus 18:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu olimara kusomera abantu ekitabu kinu, okiboheho ibaale, okinage omu kisaaru Efuraate, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.63",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.63"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "64",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:64"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi ogambe oti, ‘habw'akabi aka ndukwija kuleetera Bbabbulooni, nukwo eridikira eti, okutagaruka kwiburruka.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.64",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.64"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "64",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:64"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ebigambo bya Yeremiya nuho byahwereriire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.64",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.64"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
